      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ひ、暇だ……。\n朝から海には多くの方が遊びに来ているのに……。",
      "jp_sha256": "cf1abaab398876b5f0e1c23c4472aa33e5b5c43da815d5904350d47ffc49d438",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하, 한가하다…….\n아침부터 바다에는 많은 분이 놀러 왔는데…….",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 11,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
